# Windows installer

NSIS assisted installer is branded desktop-owned packaging: `build/installer.nsh` may contain **only** `customWelcomePage` / `customHeader` (GUI pages) — no MessageBox / Section / RequestExecutionLevel / customInstall, so silent `/S`, overwrite upgrade and the SHA512SUMS updater flow stay intact. Keep `oneClick:false`, directory choose, per-user default path, shortcuts, and artifact `Deepseek-Harness-Desktop-Setup-${version}.exe` (release.yml globs depend on it). Bitmaps are fixed-geometry 24-bit BMPs (sidebar 164×314, header 150×57) regenerated via `npm run installer:assets` from `scripts/render-installer-assets.js`; palette mirrors the icon tile + `--dsw-static-deepseek-500` — no second skin. Uninstall must not delete `userData` (dsh-home). `deleteAppDataOnUninstall` / `perMachine` stay unset.

